---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Generative Engine Solutions: Pioneering GEO Strategy and AEO Excellence - GES"
  description="Discover Generative Engine Solutions' expertise in GEO strategy, AEO optimization, and AI-driven marketing solutions. Learn about our background and approach."
  canonicalPath="/resources/about-generative-engine-solutions-pioneering-geo-strategy-and-aeo-excellence/"
>
